    "end": 4.497,
    "tags": [
     [
      "a",
      "talk/neutral"
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "His cousin pulls him out.",
    "start": 4.717,
    "end": 6.086,
    "tags": []
   },
   {
    "text": "He survives.",
    "start": 6.306,
    "end": 7.262,
    "tags": []
   },
   {
    "text": "Then they test the steam.",
    "start": 7.762,
    "end": 9.02,
    "tags": [
     [
      "a",
      "point_l/suspicious"
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It's full of deadly carbon monoxide.",
    "start": 9.24,
    "end": 11.432,
    "tags": []
   },
   {
    "text": "Because under that backyard, a coal mine fire had been burning for nearly twenty years.",
